{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794172764,"nonce":"yFI3+RNwI9NadcUASJHMDmZcJS0=","title":"L1 — git-bug read adapter and issue model","message":"## Context\nNo backend exists; the UI renders `src/mock.rs`. Everything later needs typed, safe read access to git-bug.\n\n## Files\n- `src/lib.rs` — new; `pub mod gitbug;` (lib target so unused-yet public items don't trip `-D warnings`)\n- `src/gitbug/mod.rs` — new: `Issue`, `Kind`, `Status`, `State`, `Comment`, `IssueDetail`, `GitBugError`\n- `src/gitbug/cli.rs` — new: runs `git-bug` in a repo root\n- `tests/fixtures/*.json` — new: list + show output captured from git-bug v0.11\n\n## Approach\n- Run `cargo fmt` first: trunk currently fails the `fmt` gate.\n- `cargo add serde --features derive`, `cargo add serde_json thiserror`.\n- `list(root) -\u003e Result\u003cVec\u003cIssue\u003e\u003e`: `git-bug bug -f json --by creation --direction asc`, cwd = repo root, env `GIT_EDITOR=false`.\n- `show(root, full_id) -\u003e Result\u003cIssueDetail\u003e`: `git-bug bug show \u003cid\u003e -f json`; body = `comments[0].message`, the rest are comments.\n- Port `row`/`by_layer` from `../skillforge/plugins/roadmap/skills/gb/scripts/lib/gb_core.sh:67-74`: kind/epic/state = first label with that prefix; `layer` from `^L(\\d+) — `; layered first, by number.\n- Port `gbx` error handling (`gb_core.sh:23-43`): retry 5× / 0.5s on stderr `already locked by the process`, then `GitBugError::Locked { pid }`; exit 0 with `Aborting` on stderr is a failure; drop `Building cache` lines.\n- v0.11 shapes: list rows `{id, human_id, create_time.time, edit_time.time, status, labels, title, author.name, comments: \u003ccount\u003e}`; show has `comments: [{id, human_id, author, message}]`.\n\n## Out of scope\n- Writes (L7), repo discovery (L2), any UI.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Unit tests parse the list and show fixtures into `Issue` / `IssueDetail`, covering kind/epic/state/layer extraction and layer ordering\n- Unit test: lock stderr maps to `GitBugError::Locked`, `Aborting` maps to an error\n- `cargo test`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` and `cargo fmt --check` pass, including the pre-existing fmt drift","files":null}]}